      "sha256": "3f711631ac7b81f223e08471838f8129b9716e4fe9935ebf99c58e320fc18633",
      "size_bytes": 484215744,
      "notes": "Speech model for English and German that both installers put on every machine that gets Qwen3-ASR (spec 4, B5-13, B5-28), upstream Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B, Apache-2.0 (data/models/catalog.json id qwen3-asr-0.6b-q4_k_m). Nobody else publishes a Q4_K_M of this model, so the project publishes its own in the models-v1 release on GitHub and there is no second source: build/fetch.py downloads it from there and never from Hugging Face. It is the copy the benchmark measured (build/cache/asr-fast/models/qwen3-asr-0.6b/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-Q4_K_M-bf16src.gguf on the desktop). Its tensors are byte for byte those of build/cache/convert/out/qwen3-asr-0.6b/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-Q4_K_M.gguf, which differs only in the general.name, general.basename and general.size_label metadata. Runs with models.qwen3_asr_0_6b_mmproj beside it. 484215744 bytes; hash computed 2026-09-18 from the local copy."
    },
    "qwen3_asr_0_6b_q8_0": {
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-GGUF/resolve/main/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-Q8_0.gguf",
      "version": "ggml-org/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-GGUF@main",
      "sha256": "bca259818b50ca7c4c05e9bdb35a5dc04fa039653a6d6f3f0f331f96f6aa1971",
      "size_bytes": 804749248,
      "notes": "The previous speech model for English and German (spec 4, B5-13), upstream Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B, Apache-2.0 (data/models/catalog.json id qwen3-asr-0.6b-q8_0). Neither installer carries it any more: models.qwen3_asr_0_6b_q4_k_m has the same word error rates, is faster on the processor and 320533504 bytes smaller, which is what lets a processor keep it beside Whisper for English, German and Albanian inside the 5,000,000,000-byte install budget (B5-45, B5-46). Pinned still for the benchmark and for a machine that holds only this file. 804749248 bytes; hash computed 2026-09-17 from the copy already in build/cache/models."
    },
    "qwen3_asr_0_6b_mmproj": {
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-GGUF/resolve/main/mmproj-Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-Q8_0.gguf",
